  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.1.3 stable: Version-sync with SpawnDev.WebTorrent 3.1.3. Consumers get pure-v2 BEP 52 feature parity (tracker + wire handshake + dedup + OPFS persistence + service-worker streaming + HTTP file browser + Torrent.DisplayName / DisplayNameShort / WireInfoHashHex helpers), BEP 44/46 server-side completeness, PerfectNegotiator from the RTC 1.1.3 chain, SCTP throughput tunables from SIPSorcery 10.0.5. No server source changes since 3.1.1 - pure transitive dep promotion. See SpawnDev.WebTorrent 3.1.3 release notes for the full feature set.",
